- one scouting the tender portal and webmail;
- one scouting the supplier portal and ERP;
- one researching which framework to use and testing what Qwen can do through the proxy.

When all three report back, I'll combine their findings into a plan for a slim first version and answer whether to switch frameworks.

Your CLAUDE.md says no attribution trailers in commits, so future commits won't get the session link either.

